	(text "Planned changes:\n- add zenner+fet reverse protection \n- decide if using a powerplexer for 5v in opt\n- unify grounds\n- remove option to power sensors from vcu\n- rename power nets \n- add 12v -> 5v buck\n- add 5v -> 3.3v ldo\nOR\n- add 12V -> 3.3v ldo/buck\n- add fuckass inductor\n\nBecause:\n- stop people frying board\n- vcu is a single point failure, any excess power\n  stuff like the sensor supply should be seperated\n- sensors should instead be powered from a REGULATED,\n  CONTINUOUS supply, ie a Sensor Power Module in the dash\n- +12V is NOT 12V AS IT IS STRAIGHT OFF THE BATTERY AND \n  NOT REGULATED!!! Will rename nets to convey this"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.274 89.662 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 255 153 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "eabcfe7e-a1b9-4618-83a7-91e531630b5a")
	)
